{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\nDetail of the selected board item.\n\n## Spec\n- Issues and pull requests reuse the GitHub page's detail rendering (Body / Comments); draft issues show their body only\n- A `Fields` section lists every project field value of the item (Status, Priority, Estimate, Iteration, Start / End dates, custom text / number fields)\n- Scrollable like the other detail views; `h` / `Esc` returns to the board\n\nPart of #119.\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-30T08:12:05Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":123,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Projects: item detail pane"}
